This licence covers the original work in this repository. It does not, and
cannot, cover material from other sources, which carries its own terms and
remains the property of its respective owners:

  - Software dependencies under their own licences, as declared in
    package.json and package-lock.json — including Leaflet (BSD-2-Clause)
    and leaflet-velocity (MIT).

  - Scientific data redistributed in public/map/, each retaining the terms
    of the body that produced it: GEBCO (bathymetry and isobaths), Natural
    Earth (coastline and boundaries), NOAA/NHC (storm forecasts), NOAA PMEL
    (saildrones), IOOS, NOC/BODC, OTN and VOTO (gliders), Ifremer (Argo),
    NOAA/NCEI (OISST), the US Navy via HYCOM (ESPC-D-V02 currents,
    temperature and salinity), and Marine Regions/VLIZ (EEZ boundaries).
    Each is credited on the map itself.

  - Publications, figures and photographs, whose rights rest with their
    authors, publishers or subjects.
